Package: plasma-widget-app-memory-bar
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, systemd, plasma-workspace (>= 6)
Description: Plasma 6 per-application memory monitor and limiter
 App Memory Bar monitors memory used by desktop applications through cgroup v2,
 aggregates related systemd user units, and maintains configurable per-app
 memory budgets through a persistent user backend.
